  -- `M(X) ≤ c_b b^e r` gives `M(P X) ≤ K r β` when `c x^k c_b ≤ K`, `b ≤ β`.
  have incrP : ∀ (cK Λ : ℝ≥0) (k e : ℕ) (MX Z : ℝ≥0∞) (x cb b β r K : ℝ),
